(footprint "TS06_SOIC-28W_Back_R270"
	(version 20260206)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "B.Cu")
	(uuid "9d489bac-80c6-5875-8de0-0bd985229aa9")
	(at 10.0000 6.4500)
	(descr "SOIC-28 wide body 7.5 x 17.9 mm, 1.27 mm pitch (KiCad SOIC-28W_7.5x17.9mm_P1.27mm). For MCP23017-E/SO: 1-8 GPB0-7, 9 VDD, 10 VSS, 11 NC, 12 SCL, 13 SDA, 14 NC, 15-17 A0-A2, 18 RESET, 19 INTB, 20 INTA, 21-28 GPA0-7. The silk bar marks pin 1. Mounted on the BACK: geometry mirrored in X from the KiCad library original, graphics on B.* layers. Pre-rotated 270 deg counter-clockwise (front view), per this repo's no-rotation-token convention.")
	(tags "SOIC-28W MCP23017 SMD back TERMINAL-06")
