	(uuid "4abf62ca-e56f-5cbf-8f1e-b7729b49af9f")
	(at 63.0000 51.0000)
	(descr "XS4, 2-pin JST-XH, 2.5 mm pitch, right-angle/corner variant - pads run along X so the cable exits downward off the board's bottom edge instead of straight up. Housing still overhangs the 6.5 mm board width same as the straight variant; only the two THT pins land here. Pad 1 = raw +185V in, pad 2 = switched return to SEC's MPSA42 collector. CONFIRMED 2026-09: exact housing dimensions don't matter here (same as colon) since the real connector already fits inside a standard LED pad footprint with margin - the only thing that actually matters is holding the pitch to JST-XH standard, which this footprint already does at 2.5 mm.")
